# .worktreeinclude — gitignored files Claude Code copies into each new worktree so a
# lane boots with full context. Syntax = .gitignore. Only gitignored matches are copied;
# tracked files are never duplicated. Protocol: Forj/Wiki/reference/parallel-agent-workflow.md.
#
# Deliberately EXCLUDED:
#   .render-deploy-hook  — backend deploy is main-only + Codex-owned; a worktree never
#                          deploys shared prod.
#   graphify-out/        — heavy + rebuildable via `python -m graphify update .`.
#   node_modules/ .venv/ — install fresh per worktree (see the playbook's env gotcha).

app/backend/.env
app/web/.env.local
.context/
